  "%0 中的已有关联关系": "Existing link in %0",
  "如仅需在当前表中查看记录，可使用“查询记录”字段，无需创建双向关联。如：在客户表中查看关联当前客户的订单。": "If you only need to view records in the current worksheet, use a \"Query Records\" field instead of creating a Two-way Link. For example, view orders linked to a customer in the Customers worksheet.",
  "💡 适用于被高频引用的标签、省市区、费用科目等字典表。开启后，关联时不向目标表写入反向数据，从而提升表单性能。": "💡 Suitable for high-frequency reference dictionaries like tags, regions, and expense categories. When enabled, associated data won't write back to the target table, improving form performance.",
  "如需在两个工作表中同时维护关联关系。如：项目与成员、用户与角色。则需创建为双向关联。": "To manage a link from both worksheets, such as projects and members or users and roles, create a Two-way Link.",
