  "关联工作表": "Related Worksheet",
  "- 汇总、他表字段（存储数据类型）不会自动更新，只能手动刷新。": "- Summary and Foreign Field (stored data type) values require manual refresh.",
  "建立双向关联": "Create two-way link",
  "- 当关联的记录被删除时，不会自动取消关联，将显示为已删除。": "- Deleted linked records remain linked and are shown as deleted.",
  "检测到有可建立的双向关联": "Two-way Link available",
  "“%0”中存在可添加到当前工作表的反向字段，是否使用已有关系添加反向字段？关闭后将会创建一组新的关联关系。": "“%0” has a reverse field available for the current worksheet. Use the existing link to add it? Turning this off will create a new link.",
  "当前关联记录已开启【轻量级单向关联】：当引用的数据源的字段变更后，不会同步更新本表的他表字段数据。": "Lightweight one-way link enabled: Changes in the source field will no longer sync to this field",
  "选择其他工作表中已关联 \"%0\" 的字段建立双向关联。建立后，可在两个工作表中维护同一关联关系": "Select a field linked to \"%0\" in another worksheet to create a Two-way Link, which can be managed from both worksheets.",
  "配置建议：": "Setup Tips:",
  "在当前表中存储数据，存储后他表字段可用于工作表搜索、筛选、排序、统计，或被公式、文本组合字段使用。": "After storing in the current table, fields from other tables can be used for search, filter, sort, statistics, or referenced in formulas and text-combined fields.",
