  "3、不同环境中运行产生的通知、计费、日志数据也完全隔离。": "3、Notifications, billing, and log data generated across different environments are fully isolated.",
  "2、应用开启沙盒环境后，正式环境中的结构将被锁定。在沙盒环境测试与开发，不会影响正式环境的运行，验证通过后可以发布至正式环境。": "2、Once enabled, the production structure will be locked. Testing and development in the sandbox will not affect production operations, and changes can be deployed to production upon verification.",
