  "导航色仅在浅色主题下生效": "Navigation color applies to light theme only",
  "请使用企业简称或注册商标作为短信签名；提交后需运营商审核，预计 5-10 个工作日，审核通过前该签名不可使用；签名需不少于 2 个字符且不得包含特殊符号。": "Use the company abbreviation or registered trademark as the SMS signature; carrier review takes 5-10 business days; signature cannot be used before approval; must be at least 2 characters without special symbols.",
