  "检索类型": "Retrieval Type",
  "语义检索：根据问题的含义去理解和匹配，即使用词不同也能找到相关内容，适合自然语言提问。": "Semantic Search: Understand and match based on the meaning of the question, allowing relevant results even with different wording. Ideal for natural language queries.",
  "检索类召回数量(TOP K)": "Retrieval Recall Count (TOP K)",
  "用于融合“向量+全文”的排序。数值越大排序波动越小，越小越强调最靠前结果；建议默认 60。": "Controls ranking when combining vector and full-text results. Higher values reduce ranking variance; lower values prioritize top results. Default is 60.",
  "AI 智能选择：由系统智能判断最合适的检索方式，无需手动选择，适合大多数场景。": "AI Select: Automatically determines the best retrieval method, no manual setup needed, suitable for most scenarios.",
