  "其他应用下的知识库": "Knowledge Bases in Other Apps",
  "混合检索：同时使用语义理解和关键词匹配，兼顾精准度和全面性，效果最均衡。": "Hybrid Search: Combining semantic understanding and keyword matching for balanced precision and coverage.",
  "低于该值的结果将被过滤；调高更严格（结果更少更准），调低更宽松（结果更多）。": "Results below this value will be filtered. Increase for stricter, more accurate results; decrease for broader, more results.",
