  "%0 模型按 %1信用点 / 1K tokens 计费，自动从企业中心扣除": "%0 model is billed at %1 credits per 1K tokens and will be automatically deducted from the organization account",
  "本次测试消耗 %0 tokens， 计费 %1 信用点": "This test consumed %0 tokens and was charged %1 credits.",
  "根据查询条件从聚合表中获取一条记录": "Retrieve a record from the aggregate table based on the query",
  "从聚合表中按筛选条件选择符合的多条记录数据，供后续节点使用": "Filter and select multiple matching records from the aggregated table for use in subsequent nodes",
  "从聚合表中筛选符合条件的数据并进行汇总计算，如:记录数量、求和、平均、最大、最小等。注意:聚合表的数据有一定延时。": "Filter data from the aggregate table based on specified criteria and perform summary calculations, such as record count, sum, average, maximum, and minimum. Note: Data in the aggregate table may have a certain delay.",
