  "在下方配置智能体的工具，智能体将调用工具完成任务": "Configure agent tools for task execution",
  "定义模型的查询范围，未配置意味着Agent会查询工作表中的所有数据": "Define the query scope for the model; defaults to the entire worksheet if not configured",
  "按用户权限": "Access by user permissions",
  "智能体可参考的历史消息轮数，轮数越多，智能体理解上下文能力越强，但也会增加上下文处理和Token消耗": "More history rounds enhance context understanding but increase processing and token usage",
  "记忆轮次": "Memory Turn",
  "模型将由系统自动选择，当前版本不支持手动修改。消耗Token数将从组织信用点中扣除": "The model is auto-selected by the system, manual changes are not supported, and token usage will be deducted from organization credits",
