  "封装业务流程已删除": "PBP has been deleted",
  "对工作表数据分组统计汇总，帮助智能体在流程中自动完成统计分析与结果判断": "Group and summarize worksheet data for AI to perform statistical analysis and result evaluation",
  "附件可来自用户上传或工作表字段，智能体会将附件内容作为上下文传递给模型。使用该功能可能产生较多费用。图片、PDF 仅能在选择了具备图像识别能力的模型时解析；文档由文档识别服务解析（0.72 信用点/附件）。": "Attachments can come from user uploads or worksheet fields, serving as context for the model. This feature may incur higher costs. Image and PDF parsing is supported with image-recognition models, while documents are processed via a document recognition service (0.72 credits/attachment)",
  "附件可来自用户上传或工作表字段，智能体会将附件内容作为上下文传递给模型。使用该功能可能产生较多费用。图片、PDF 仅能在选择了具备图像识别能力的模型时解析；文档由文档识别服务解析。": "Attachments can come from user uploads or worksheet fields, serving as context for the model. This feature may incur higher costs. Image and PDF parsing is supported with image-recognition models, while documents are processed via a document recognition service.",
  "AI 生成": "Generate with AI",
  "仅支持通过明道云代发邮件。邮件%0/封，将自动从企业账户扣除。": "Only supports sending emails through Mingdao. %0 per email, will be automatically deducted from the business account",
  "描述智能体的角色、任务目标及注意事项，优质的提示词能显著提升回答准确性。可使用“AI 生成”自动生成": "Define the agent's role, objectives, and key considerations. Well-crafted prompts greatly improve response accuracy. Use 'Generate with AI' for automatic suggestions.",
  "取消勾选，工具执行时将不按用户的数据权限，智能体可访问并返回超出用户本身权限范围的数据。请谨慎使用。": "After unchecking, the tool will ignore user data permissions, allowing agents to access and return data beyond user scope. Please use with caution.",
  "添加工具": "Add Tool",
  "调用前需用户确认": "Require user confirmation before calling",
  "从聚合表获取记录": "Retrieve records from aggregate table",
  "输出参数用于定义智能体在执行后输出的结构化字段。你可以添加多个参数并为每个参数编写说明，智能体将根据说明尝试生成结果，供后续流程引用。参数输出结果依赖大模型的理解能力，可能存在失败的情况。": "Output params define the structured fields returned by the agent after execution. You can add multiple parameters with descriptions, guiding the agent to generate results for use in subsequent workflows. Outputs depend on the model's understanding and may occasionally vary.",
  "启用后，待办消息同时会以邮件的形式发送给相关负责人；邮件0.03信用点/封，自动从账务中心扣费": "When enabled, to-do notifications will be emailed to responsible parties at a cost of 0.03 credits each, deducted automatically from the business account",
