  "从聚合表中筛选符合条件的数据并进行汇总计算，如：记录数量、求和、平均、最大、最小等。注意：当汇总他表字段或者数据频繁变更时可能有一定延时": "Filter eligible data from the aggregate table and calculate summaries like count, sum, average, max, and min. Note: Aggregation from other tables or frequent data updates may cause delays",
  "对话触发后，系统将依序执行工作流中各节点。最终汇总所有 AI Agent节点的输出内容，作为本轮对话的完整回复展示给用户": "After the dialogue is triggered, the system executes workflow nodes in sequence and combines all AI Agent outputs into a single response for the current round",
