  "描述 AI Agent 节点的角色定位、任务目标及注意事项。优质的提示词能显著提升回答准确性。可使用“AI 生成”辅助生成": "Define the agent's role, objectives, and key considerations. Well-crafted prompts greatly improve response accuracy. Use 'Generate with AI' for automatic suggestions.",
