  "附件上传未启用。前往“编辑对话机器人 > 其他”启用“上传附件”": "Attachment uploads are disabled. Please enable them under 'Edit Chatbot > Others'",
  "取消勾选后，工具执行时将忽略用户数据权限，Agent 可访问并返回超出用户权限范围的数据，谨慎操作。": "If unchecked, the tool may access and return data beyond the user's permission scope. Proceed with caution.",
