  "AI 动作用于在记录上下文中解决特定业务场景的问题，例如分析讨论内容、给出行动建议或产出沟通文案；AI 动作将显示在记录页右侧，供用户点击触发": "Apply AI Actions to records to address specific business scenarios, such as analyzing discussions, suggesting actions, or drafting communications. These options appear on the right side of the record page for users to trigger.",
