  "显示列设置": "Column Settings",
  "- 组织成员只允许使用组织的Microsoft帐户单点登录": "- Only allow organization members to log in with their Microsoft accounts",
  "将向配置的数据库地址运行一条内容为 “ping=1”的命令 ，若在 5 秒内可以正常连接并收到返回内容，则视为测试通过。注：未通过测试不可保存，系统会强制校验": "Run the command \"ping=1\" on the configured database address. If a response is received within 5 seconds, the test passes. If the test fails, saving is not allowed, and the system enforces validation",
