  "- 您本平台的组织已集成 Microsoft Entra 并完成所有用户同步": "- Your organization has integrated Microsoft Entra and completed user sync",
  "支持单机与副本集，副本集请输入多个数据库地址和端口，且包含主节点": "Supports standalone and replica set. For replica set, enter multiple database addresses and ports, including the primary node",
