  "启用后:": "After enabling:",
  "- 由 Microsoft Entra 统一管理组织成员的密码策略、登录校验和二次验证": "- Password policies, login authentication, and Multi-Factor Authentication (MFA) are centrally managed by Microsoft Entra",
