  "- 您已在 Microsoft Entra 管理所有组织成员": "- You are managing all members in Microsoft Entra",
  "- 禁止其他所有登录方式（密码、验证码、个人SSO等），避免绕过企业安全策略": "- Disable all other login methods (e.g., password, verification code, personal SSO) to enforce enterprise security policies",
  "- 同步以 Microsoft Entra 为主，停用/删除用户，平台会解除账号绑定关系，并做离职处理": "-Sync with Microsoft Entra as the primary source. Disabled or deleted users will be unbound and marked as offboarded",
  "确定同步？": "Sync now?",
  "使用 Microsoft Entra 租户管理员账号完成授权后，平台将以只读方式访问 Entra （原 Azure AD，Microsoft 365 的统一身份目录），同步用户信息用于平台创建、更新成员，平台不会修改 Entra 目录中的任何数据。授权完成后，可在「单点登录设置」中将 Microsoft Entra 设为本组织的唯一登录方式。": "After authorizing with your Microsoft Entra admin account, the platform will access Entra (formerly Azure AD) in read-only mode to sync user information for managing members. No data will be modified. Once authorized, you can enable Microsoft Entra as the sole login method in SSO settings.",
  "绑定到已有组织用户：%0个；新增组织用户%1个，删除与组织用户绑定关系%2个": "Bound to existing organization users: %0; Added organization users: %1; Unbound organization users: %2",
  "- 平台会给未绑定组织用户的 Microsoft Entra 用户创建一个组织账号绑定": "- The platform will create organizational account bindings for unlinked Microsoft Entra users",
  "黑名单": "Blacklist",
  "可在 Microsoft Entra 后台创建一个安全组，并将需要同步到平台的成员加入该组，平台后续仅同步该安全组内的用户及其相关信息；如不填写安全组（GroupID 为空），则默认同步目录下的全部成员。具体操作可参考": "Create a security group in the Microsoft Entra portal and add members to be synced. The platform syncs only users and related info within this group. If no security group is specified (GroupID is empty), all directory members are synced. For reference",
  "连接 Microsoft Entra": "Connect to Microsoft Entra",
  "连接 Microsoft Entra / Microsoft 365 组织目录": "Connect Microsoft Entra / Microsoft 365 Organization Directory",
  " Microsoft Entra 管理员已授权此组织，平台将以只读方式访问您的Microsoft Entra目录，用于同步员工账号信息，不会修改任何数据。": "Your organization has been authorized by a Microsoft Entra admin. The platform will access your Microsoft Entra directory in read-only mode to sync employee accounts without altering your data.",
