  "基于应用成员协作便利考量，若在讨论中 @用户，则表示期望被 @者知晓当前数据。此时即便被 @人无当前视图或记录权限，只要拥有工作表权限，就能通过消息链接以只读形式查看记录。": "To facilitate collaboration, mentioning @user in discussions notifies them of relevant data. With table access, they can view records in read-only mode via the message link, even without current view or record permissions",
  "配置插件运行时所需要的环境参数，采用JSON格式。优先读取应用中配置的参数，应用中未配置时读取组织中配置的参数。": "Configure plugin runtime env parameters in JSON, prioritizing application-level settings; fallback to organization-level settings if not configured",
