  "开启后可上传附件。使用该功能可能产生较多费用。为保证体验，请选择上下文长度较大的模型。图片和PDF 由模型解析（需在 AI 智能体节点配置具备图像识别能力的模型）；文档由文档识别服务解析（0.72 信用点/附件）": "Enable to upload attachments. This may incur higher costs. For better experience, use models with larger context length. Images and PDFs require models with OCR capability (configured in AI agent node); documents are processed by the document recognition service (0.72 credits/attachment)",
