  "明细（开发中）": "Details (In Development)",
  "开票测试说明：本操作将生成个人抬头的正式发票（非演示票），发票会入账并发送至你指定的邮箱。如不需要，请及时在电子税务局/百望进行红冲或作废": "Invoice Test Instructions: This operation generates an official invoice in your name. The invoice will be added to your account and sent to your email. If unnecessary, please cancel it promptly via the Electronic Tax Bureau or Baiwang.",
