  "是否包含": "Does it contain",
  "示例：=JOIN(部门字段,\"-\")，结果：\"产品部-销售部-研发部\"": "Example: =JOIN(Department field, \"-\"), result: \"Product Department - Sales Department - R&D Department\"",
