  "只能从当前用户是应用管理员和开发者的应用中选取。": "Can only select apps where the current user is an admin or developer.",
  "以“Asia/Shanghai”时区举例，这里填入数据库服务器对应的时区信息": "Example: Use \"Asia/Shanghai\" timezone; Enter the corresponding database server timezone info",
  "测试连接创建数据源时，检查数据库服务器的连通性、账户密码等正确性、数据库是否可用、以及检查是否可以作为源或者目的地。只有数据源通过全部测试才能够正常使用数据源。": "When testing the connection to create a data source, the system checks the connectivity of the database server, the accuracy of the account credentials, the availability of the database, and whether it can be used as a source or destination. The data source can only be used after passing all tests.",
  "MongoDB 版本 >= 3.6": "MongoDB version >= 3.6",
  "如果数据源的连接器选项配置和数据库服务器配置不一致时，可能会出现同步错误或者创建同步任务失败的情况。此时可尝试添加额外的连接器选项参数配置。": "If connector options and database server settings mismatch, sync errors or task creation failures may occur. Try adding extra connector parameters.",
  "指定当前MariaDB服务器的时区": "Set the time zone for the current MariaDB server",
  "Change Streams仅支持副本集和分片群集模式，且必须使用副本集协议版本1（pv1）": "Change Streams are only supported in replica set and sharded cluster modes, and must use replica set protocol version 1 (pv1)",
