  "最大支持批量执行1000行记录，是否只选中并执行前1000行数据？": "Batch execution supports up to 1,000 records. Only the first 1,000 records will be processed？",
  "通过批量编辑，您可以快速统一修改相同字段的数据内容。": "With batch editing, you can quickly uniformly modify the data content of the same fields.",
