  "输入您不能参加的理由": "Enter your reason for not participating",
  "2.支付渠道：拉卡拉(费率0.3%)、微信支付/支付宝支付(费率以签约渠道为准)。": "2. Payment Channels: Lakala (0.3% rate), WeChat Pay / Alipay (rate as per channel contract).",
  "反馈入口暂未开放": "Feedback entry is not available yet",
  "将复制该自定义动作及其对应工作流，复制后的工作流与原工作流配置一致": "Duplicate this custom action and its associated workflow. The copied workflow has identical configurations to the original",
  "由拉卡拉提供，暂时需要联系顾问线下申请商户入网；支持微信和支付宝聚合支付，费率固定为0.3%": "Provided by Lakala. Merchant onboarding needs offline application through consultant. Supports WeChat and Alipay aggregated payment, fixed rate: 0.3%",
  "请联系您的专属顾问协助完成商户入网": "Contact your dedicated consultant for merchant onboarding",
  "格式化规则MMM/MMMM/ddd/dddd可以依据当前用户的个人语言，呈现不同的形式。如需指定按英文的规则呈现，可以在格式后添加 #EN#。": "MMM/MMMM/ddd/dddd format rules vary with the current user's locale. Add #EN# at the end of the format to use English rendering.",
  "密码包含当前加密方式不支持的字符": "Password contains unsupported characters for the current encryption algorithm",
  "是指通过代理访问的目标 URL 的协议类型": "It refers to the protocol type of the target URL accessed via proxy",
  "原模型已下架，将使用系统替代模型": "The original model is offline, and the system replacement model will be used",
  "当上一节点审批人同意后，从设置的选择范围中选择本节点审批人。上一审批节点必须配置“通过意见”，否则此配置不生效。若涉及多人审批，仅在或签模式下支持此操作。": "After the previous node approves, pick the current node approver from the configured scope. The prior node must have approval opinion enabled, or this configuration is invalid. Multi-person scenario: supported only for OR approval.",
  "当以上指定的其中一个字段新增或更新时将触发流程，如未指定则表示任何字段新增或更新时都会触发": "Trigger workflow if any specified field is created or updated. If no fields specified, any field addition or update triggers the workflow",
